zt, GM2\n\nDevelopers\nButedMesa: Sound Designer\nl2sb: Builder\nkkontrast: Scripter\nvalorantjuy: Modeler\nghjmyuymtutrmy : VFX,Modeler\n\n\nSpecial Thanks To\nDrCamper: Clothing Assets\nTarvero: Thumbnail, etc\nFantichz\nnichekino\n\n","path":"/game/17126500142-release-abyss-miner","slug":"17126500142-release-abyss-miner","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/704e910e3a6f8ab6ba55a3302c530eb33702a7e57db2fd3a2c26e707f8f47243.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-16cffca57c7669d0ed2abd57962c3dc7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":6283188,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-27T12:07:57.882Z","creator":{"name":"The Abyss Dwellers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6220960770,"name":"Blades World ⚔️","desc":"Welcome to the World of Blades!\n\n⚡Train to become more POWERFUL\n🤺 FIGHT other players\n💪 DOMINATE the server\n⚔️ Unlock and unbox RARE BLADES\n\n(Exciting updates every week!)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGames this is related to:\nSword Simulator, Sword Simulator 2, Weapon Masters, Weapon Simulator, Scythe Simulator, Reborn As Swordman, Strong Sword Simulator, Weapon Legends Simulator","path":"/game/6220960770-blades-world","slug":"6220960770-blades-world","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/fa41a17bcdd95476462fb5e1729576a91969fb544f10c4c68d42261c8c966a08.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f3e2710106a88df7b28c1d1f3710bf71/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":13719870,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-07T18:53:52.549Z","creator":{"name":"Blades World","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":28382335,"name":"Survival Zombie Tycoon","desc":"🧟 Welcome to Survival Zombie Tycoon!\n\n🪚 Collect resources to build a defensive base!\n🛡️ Gear up with a huge variety of guns, armors & swords!\n🤝 Team up with friends & adventure into different worlds!\n⚔️ Battle & survive against relentless nights of the undead!\n🌎 Compete against players globally to the top leaderboards!\n\n⭐ Use code 90KLIKES for a free Rebirth!\n👍 Like & favorite for a new code at 95K!\n\n➡️ Join the group for in-game rewards & codes!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/12353833/DBUP-Studios\n\n💎 Premium Benefits\n🌟 Unique chat tag\n✨ Unique overhead icon\n💰 2X Cash and Energy (4X with Double Value game pass)","path":"/game/28382335-survival-zombie-tycoon","slug":"28382335-survival-zombie-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/58cf9e0ea8f89619513fb34258001dc7e644a04939c9a7ada7368232fc8fdf1e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d6d5b6f35c40f98c4cac7a2199e26a92/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":62033130,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-05-13T19:00:23.108Z","creator":{"name":"Husslematic","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":8426789885,"name":"Beat Up Dummies Simulator","desc":"Beat up dummies with a variety of weapons and combos to achieve blows which can be used to unlock better weapons to beat up dummies (and players) with. Defeat bosses and complete quests to unlock unique special weapons to further enhance your combative abilities.\nGroup for questions/updates: https://www.roblox.com/groups/10406903/Funny-Combat-Group#!/about\n\nNotes:\n- DELETING BADGES OBTAINED FROM THIS GAME MAY ERASE DATA.\n- IF YOUR DATA IS RESET, PLEASE LEAVE & REJOIN IMMEDIATELY\n- This game is developed by only one person. Updates may take a while or longer than anticipated.\n- It's suggested, but not mandatory to play on PC. Playing on other devices may be difficult.\n- Some updates/fixes may be imperfect. This game is prone to bugs and oversights.\n- Yes, I am aware there are games with similar names to this one. This game is not an attempt to rip-off those of similarity to it.\n\nSpecial thanks to those who helped with ideas, testing updates, and reporting bugs.","path":"/game/8426789885-beat-up-dummies-simulator","slug":