ver, and prove yourself as the ultimate swordsman. \n\n🚨 Exploiting will get you PERMANENTLY banned. so DONT use executors... or else... \n🎶 I do not own any sounds/music in this game. For copyright concerns, feel free to DM me. \n\n😊 Thank YOU for playing :D\n\n🎵 Music Credits: DM DOKURO, JJK, Derpcat, Yun Jedy (天亦海), PinpinNeon, Dutonic, Battlejuice, and YourAverageLoser. \n💡 Inspired by: Slap Battles, Sword Fight on the Heights, Killstreak Chaos, and more!","path":"/game/16945218529-killstreak-sword-fighting","slug":"16945218529-killstreak-sword-fighting","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/4b0536f9892fe66348d65badb04857e9ecb3619fd9e675471a5feaca9942f155.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cf7c3bdf175404ca9c9711bf5c2e69f9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":15,"visitor":13351609,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-20T15:29:43.500Z","creator":{"name":"wavs chamber","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11233948433,"name":"[📱MOBILE UPD] Devas Of Creation","desc":"🌍 Dive into an epic world of dungeons, hidden treasures, and stunning landscapes. 🌄\n🎮 Level up your hero, join one of three Devas factions, craft powerful gear, and compete in the Ranked Arena! 🥇 \n🛡️ Form parties and join clans to take down raid bosses for legendary loot!\n⚒️ Master life skills like crafting and fishing to become an artisan. 🐟 \n⚔️ Complete the Daily Hunt Quest for valuable rewards and XP.\n🐾 Collect pets and mounts to aid you on your journey.\n\n👉 Play now and start your adventure!\n\nPlatform Availability (**Now available on mobile!**) :\n💻 PC,  Mobile📱, Tablet, Laptop, Console with Mouse and Keyboard","path":"/game/11233948433-mobile-upd-devas-of-creation","slug":"11233948433-mobile-upd-devas-of-creation","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/fd73f845d9135697842be8b83d277d94005abcc39427526430a41eb109ba1b9a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f2e442ad61d343da7f0adc1e15a24b3c/150/150/Im